            <ArticleTitle>[Postmastectomy pain syndrome evidence based guidelines and decision trees].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>275-85</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A multidisciplinary expert group had reviewed all scientific data available of post mastectomy pain syndrome. Seventy six publications were retained and thirty evidence based diagnosis, treatment and follow-up recommendations are listed. Few of theses recommendations are classed level A. Datas analysis make possible to propose a strategy based on systematic association of drugs, kinesitherapy and psychological support. Evaluation and closer follow-up are necessary. Several decisional trees are proposed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
